<title>EGYPT: Egypt, Israel start summit to revive peace.</title>
<headline>Egypt, Israel start summit to revive peace.</headline>
<dateline>SHARM EL-SHEIKH, Egypt 1997-05-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Egypt's President Hosni Mubarak and Israel's Prime Minister Benjamin Netanyahu started a summit on Tuesday which aims to revive Middle East peace talks.</p>
<p>Witnesses said they started their meeting at a luxury hotel in this Egyptian Red Sea resort. Egyptian Foreign Minister Amr Moussa held a separate meeting with his Israeli counterpart David Levy.</p>
</text>
